OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court over explosives found
OL,4,Anear Aberfan Memorial Garden days
OL,5,Abefore Royal visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has appeared in court after
OL,8,Fsuspected explosives were found near
OL,9,Fthe Aberfan Memorial Garden days before
OL,10,Fa Royal visit to mark the disaster's
OL,11,F60th anniversary.
OL,13,FStefan Dale, 38, is charged with making
OL,14,Fan explosive substance with intent to
OL,15,Fendanger life or injure property.
OL,17,FSouth Wales Police said the discovery
OL,18,Fwas made on the Taff Trail, between the
OL,19,Fcemetery and the memorial garden, on 17
OL,20,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
